  "goodToKnow": "Ungerade means odd, of numbers: ungerade Zahlen (1, 3, 5), ungerade Hausnummern on one side of the street. The opposite, gerade, means even (2, 4, 6) and also straight or just now: Ich komme gerade. Ungerade can also mean not straight, uneven: eine ungerade Linie, though schief is more common. Odd in the sense of strange is seltsam."
